<Layout pageTitle="Speaking" description="Talks by Will Amaral on software architecture, micro-frontends and engineering quality when working with AI.">
  <h1>Speaking</h1>
  <p>I speak about software architecture, engineering practices and the decisions behind them. These talks draw on the questions and trade-offs I've encountered working with engineering teams.</p>
  <h2>TDC Florianópolis 2026</h2>
  <p>Two talks at <a href="https://thedevconf.com/tdc/2026/florianopolis/">The Developer's Conference</a>, delivered in Portuguese.</p>
