    <p class="meta">Design de Código</p>
    <p lang="en">How engineers maintain software quality when AI writes code, exploring cognitive debt and the role of engineering judgment.</p>
  </section>
  <section lang="pt-BR">
    <h3>Micro-frontends: quando usar e por que a maioria das implementações falha</h3>
    <p class="meta">Front-end</p>
    <p lang="en">When micro-frontends make sense, the trade-offs they introduce and why implementations often fall short. Drawing on real project experience to examine the architectural and organizational decisions involved.</p>
  </section>
